{"id":"561829","name":"糖三角","author":"给宝贝做的饭","authorId":"1900992","desc":"","cover":"images/561829/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"300克"},{"name":"水","amount":"155克"},{"name":"油","amount":"3克"},{"name":"糖","amount":"10克"},{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"3克"}],"sub":[{"name":"红糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"把所有面团原料混合和成光滑的面团，盖上保鲜膜醒5分钟。","img":"images/561829/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"红糖擀开与少许面粉混合均匀。","img":"images/561829/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"醒好的面团搓成长条，下成7-8个剂子。","img":"images/561829/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"擀成圆片。","img":"images/561829/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"往里折三条边，整理成三角形。","img":"images/561829/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"翻面，包入适量红糖馅。","img":"images/561829/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"提起三个角，捏在一起。","img":"images/561829/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"用筷子分别把三个角夹一下，生坯就做好了。如图所示。","img":"images/561829/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"做好的生坯放入美遇蒸烤箱里，发酵至2倍大。","img":"images/561829/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"选择蒸汽模式，100度18分钟即可。","img":"images/561829/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/561829/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/561829/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/561829/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/561829/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}